 "text": "@0xAphelion I\u2019m here to buy the top in the mid-high 60s and then tell myself it\u2019s a long term DCA hold once it retraces the whole thing https://t.co/ZNL2lgyeJ5", "source": "Twitter for iPhone", "retweetCount": 1, "replyCount": 3, "likeCount": 134, "quoteCount": 0, "viewCount": 8769, "createdAt": "Wed Aug 19 22:31:03 +0000 2026", "lang": "en", "bookmarkCount": 3, "isReply": true, "inReplyToId": "2090204379051614416", "conversationId": "2090201763987279967", "media": [{"type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQHmTT2W0AAJuup.jpg", "expanded_url": "https://x.com/CryptoCred/status/2090204926920024461/photo/1", "video_url": null}], "inReplyToUserId": "1440280368255410189", "author": {"type": "user", "userName": "CryptoCred", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoCred", "id": "899558268795842561", "name": "Cred", "isVerified": false, "isBlueVerified": true, "profilePicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1444398863268339717/2jQUsbjB_normal.jpg", "coverPicture": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/899558268795842561/1589910399", "description": "Always trader, often shitposter, sometimes educator. @breakoutprop", "location": "London", "followers": 837357, "following": 1160, "createdAt": "Mon Aug 21 09:06:19 +0000 2017", "canDm": true}, "quoted_tweet": null, "retweeted_tweet": null}, {"type": "tweet", "id": "2090201763987279967", "url": "https://x.com/CryptoCred/status/2090201763987279967", "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/CryptoCred/status/2090201763987279967", "text": "Real talk \n\nIf you\u2019re on the wrong side during a big move like this, most of your immediate impulses are gonna suck\n\nGreatest hits:\n\n1. Revenge short - Can\u2019t believe I missed this piece of shit scam pumping; it\u2019s up so much it HAS to come down\n\n2. Oversized buy - I will use leverage as a time travel machine to make up for being late\n\n3. TA cope - It has to retest the exact level it broke out from immediately because I watched two whole Babypips videos on 1.5x speed\n\n4. All-or-nothing - My only options are 0%. exposure or 100%, nothing in between exists \n\n5. Deer in headlights - oh geez I guess I should wait for a pullback but no what if the consolidation is the pullback hmm maybe I\u2019ll wait for a range to form but what if that range breaks down do I buy the retest of the breakout or the range reclaim oh man fuck shit what\u2019s Ansem saying \n\n6. Overtrader - I will cement my bloodline on the 5 minute chart; if this next candle is the wrong colour I will either be rich or poor \n\nJust chill out, delete your levels, pretend you haven\u2019t looked at the chart in weeks - fresh eyes\n\nThen it\u2019s the usual list of simple questions:\n\n1. What signals are firing / what do I think is gonna happen \n\n2. What kind of bet am I making (mean reversion/volatility expansion/new trend/momentum/Blackrock scam etc.) and on what time horizon \n\n3. Where am I wrong \n\n4. Does my position size match the current volatility and align with the shape of my trade idea i.e. points 1-3\n\nFWIW I\u2019m washed but gonna try to jam some spot sub 70k. If it gets accepted below 66-67k (retraces the breakout) then I\u2019ll lose money\n\n\u201cWow it\u2019s up so much what you buy the top?\u201d \n\nThen I\u2019ll lose money and look silly on social media. That\u2019s the cost of doing business (at least the first one). \n\nJust start LARPing like everyone else and instead of saying \u201cI bought the top\u201d say \u201cI aggressively rebalanced when an ensemble of carefully weighed momentum factor signals fired contemporaneously.\u201d", "source": "Twitter for iPhone", "retweetCount": 258, "replyCount": 105, "likeCount": 2620, "quoteCount": 45, "viewCount": 299716, "createdAt": "Wed Aug 19 22:18:29 +0000 2026", "lang": "en", "bookmarkCount": 1065, "isReply": false, "inReplyToId": null, "conversationId": "2090201763987279967", "media": [], "inReplyToUserId": null, "author": {"type": "user", "userName": "CryptoCred", "ur